    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_gums_resins_naval_stores; processing_state=unspecified; land_basis=terrestrial_forest): Gum lac in its trade forms (seed-, shell-, stick-lac and lac dye); 'Seed' here is seed-lac, not an oilseed. Layer-1 observations: 50 rows, 1871–1906. Series: HCPP_Annual Statement of Trade ×50. Units: CWTS (Hundredweights) ×50. Top routes: World → United Kingdom ×8; Straits Settlements → United Kingdom ×6; Other Foreign Countries → United Kingdom ×5; British India Bengal → United Kingdom ×4."@en ;
